@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@email = tester@chaekdami.local
@password = password123

### 0. 로그인 (accessToken 저장)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.accessToken);
%}

### 1. 알림용 상태 조회 (스펙 014 R4.1). 저장한 설정이 없으면 settings는 기본값
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/reminder-status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2. 알림 설정 저장 (R4.5). weeklyGoalMinutes는 30~3000
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/me/reminder-settings
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enabled": true,
  "earlyLateMuted": false,
  "weeklyGoalMinutes": 300
}

### 3. 주간 목표가 범위를 벗어나면 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/me/reminder-settings
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enabled": true,
  "earlyLateMuted": false,
  "weeklyGoalMinutes": 10
}
